OL,3,GNEWSAPolice dismiss online claims of
OL,4,Asex offender
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have reassured people there is
OL,7,Fno evidence to support claims on social
OL,8,Fmedia of a serial sexual offender.
OL,10,FReports of several attacks in Bury St
OL,11,FEdmunds, Suffolk, have circulated
OL,12,Fonline.
OL,14,FSuffolk Police said it was still
OL,15,Fappealing for information relating to
OL,16,Fone incident where a woman reported
OL,17,Fbeing sexually assaulted in the area of
OL,18,FParkway and Kings Road on 10 October.
